warning[SCXML039]: `<foreach item>` must be a variable name, but `class` is a reserved word in ECMAScript
 --> tests/ui/scxml039-foreach-item-reserved-word.scxml:5:36
  |
5 |       <foreach array="names" item="class" index="i"><log expr="i"/></foreach>
  |                                    ^^^^^ reserved word
  |
  = note: `<foreach>` assigns each array element (`item`) and its position (`index`) to a variable with this name; an ECMAScript reserved word such as `class` can never name a variable
  = help: rename the loop variable, for example `classItem`, and use that name inside the loop
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §4.6 <foreach>
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §B.2 The ECMAScript Data Model
help: rename the loop variable to `classItem`
